{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1453,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6c6cb0a2a5b34dd9b2df2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清爽且华丽。无论是作为运动员\n还是作为表演者，都能大放异彩的服装呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72cb9c5757cf672125eaee5e0c6ae52595d9667cebf3e90cb716006ea93401da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c33f138eada0cee0a745cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的厂商，是怎么做到\n和学园合作的呢……\n果然是靠脚踏实地的营业活动吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1b6f8259f4e3f1ca5da1253686509c630c43f5c2f8085326038463e9977899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb001bacde41b1af7052a836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是寄托了对比赛的认真态度的\n决胜服！我要优雅且\n稳健地夺取胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "652f0624e0a80344f4d3da1abc921835eb008aa14b032ac6b3b519cb1e958437",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d52af4f237555683faaa21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和设计一样，我也很重视\n跑起来是否方便。\n如果赢不了，那不就没有意义了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "039630ca6237c07c05e9f7920a6806be9da59338a91be5ed894d4452abbd2fc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab78fbb49040558bf61a6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是平时还是假日，起床时间\n我都保持一致。\n为了维持身体状态呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03709db6f8bebbd9ed25b7d07afc5344689fa52eb473bcd614f35e8bb44fe356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed34372e87fd8ead3944e090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从香港买了新的茶叶回来。\n休息时要不要一起喝点？\n想跟你分享一下感想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05d6a138fc2fcd91fcffef3d88b98810ef9bccb9db01bf0f65ac260e50e6b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9128285019cb6a04d1c4804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回去之后真想好好泡个澡啊～……！\n身体放松下来的那一瞬间，\n真是让人欲罢不能呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9774bba926fa99b90e7ac2aba7826a4c75d64394d2688a369de39bbc340f03a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c88ffe49c6cba487dd8a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最喜欢这个季节了！\n因为这是许多新事物诞生、\n希望膨胀的时期呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "deaa33178587d383cb6c93aa60affda060fa75262726d8d5ffb74cf703b0ad52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f464487169c6bf2758337f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有在涂防晒霜吗？\n考虑到未来的体质，\n从现在开始采取对策是很重要的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18de2b2c6220789b7fb1ae26c7f0dab49b0ed2ccee01d47e8871642b5633877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b56c94ddf8fb703ae1c5472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到变色的叶子，就能感受到\n时间的流逝呢……必须趁今年\n把要做的事记下来才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c1ca37d10fbf37b23f0d44f5204d424f268b39d50cf95091aa234e419123021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:849cfea68a08cbcb40d00de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……日本的冬天好冷啊……\n因为和香港完全不同，\n这种温差真叫人吃惊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7cf7d3db5393376a0e5cd37721e947779d3567e93daa7c22db516d85c61c76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f4212544a50db4712c90aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和芭蕾同学的VR走钢丝对决，\n完全赢不了！那种平衡感，\n总有一天我也要掌握它……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d72e63176bc96023e132772b982be28baf348968b995fdabd734e5e59b40a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12390325e302ce5f551636fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放同学说听过香港流行乐……\n呜呜……我在房间里随口哼歌，\n被她听到了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6fd68b26f9286e7a78cbf6b2be995b97388e050b0ca40a36af6a0c2f38238c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a3810ef64cc0e99bd2af1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次该给强击讲讲去哪个国家\n度假的事呢？看着她那\n亮晶晶的双眼，真是太可爱了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "35860c7e69852f84f081a2c64ad76aa45c198567b618684bf618f1a93106e9cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e53d0452c9a7a58632331ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果和重要的人去香港的海边，\n我推荐半月湾哦。\n呵呵，你想邀请的人是谁呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "76feb1c8724741886a5e2e16b1fa091d95cbeb9f82f49bb6b9063d1f88829396",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:816bee820412b62aaf58e1f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀，头上有东西……！\n原来只是花饰歪了吗――\n……咳，请把它忘了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a9c572186fdfbbd7a9e5b7a1c5d649b5638ed827d2ba3c30bed3f8012b4ffad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ddfa72d7ca5275b16dd3a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起床整理完资料后，\n去泳池游了一会儿。真是个不错的\n一天开端！你也要试试吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad55c523e7051c2d326025c983805de7968eb41e1f90aeb0f6e63dd430e431f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5130cc33ffa13b38d6d6141",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳池训练也很不错呢。\n对提升力量和核心也非常有效。\n……才怪，我只是想进去玩♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8147c09071903ce7d17dad59f256fd2ddb71ec4605e84f8f2a7fa3ffccb9de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b64815b31253e306b627ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到洗澡时间就能听到\n小北的歌声。虽然听着很舒服，\n但……栗东宿舍，离得挺远的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14150050014e1aa8bf5affadd84ecf61331a61adc49adcaa7b72f680d602564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecec1f27d65ce919c475fddd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "香港已经是可以在海里游泳的季节了！\n小时候总是等不及，\n让游泳圈和期待一起膨胀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c94feddb23e21e21eed649cab0eca3dd412e3a275db831a679ac1b3c3838c2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbc2f4fc66b489f07d85727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没被暑气打倒吧？我用冷冻过的\n水果做了奶昔，这就\n给你拿过去。好啦，休息休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a216d5017cfa29a4f39d987aa96a585508af0efa2d686121a909743953a02c3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45afa68ebb5787df5250696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中秋节我会从名店订购超多月饼。\n呵呵，真想快点看到吃得很香的\n高尚啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed73936ba653cedb28471a7385165d81cc7b3de0869a9c3d34ca638483469da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece82ba8a54b4a7303957910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，还挺冷的呢。\n干脆去冬泳，以此来磨炼\n意志力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e460f42bff5f54fa69fdbe57e5de75bfe6839160cd5e04f9e82cbd42871f8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bf224091effe1ff4a6f4e83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个花纹啊，是妈妈亲手缝制、\n爸爸深深迷恋上的设计哦。\n我也会让胜利女神为之倾倒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f4412a5748ddf969c0a7549edf90f1675046111582ac01cadd095dc92b7009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9812a455d7bde629ba2cc3c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把草帽内侧改成防晒布料来\n遮光的方案，我可是推动通过了哦。\n这都要归功于精心准备的演示资料呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e9856e573d2a55bfa0d36065f976ac05fbd0d73f60f905cb3842ea4ee028e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b204af9beb752cc428a015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要一往无前地\n全速迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5dbf33d7e1f8df3d2b9e5f5459e678cbbb801d902a9de2225d6fc08b61728c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d101db5f53925153e43a1705",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66aed8ffea8497edd70d3d40d25d47f5df2a9a8c26d622b7d7ab9527445b85e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89967fab6e4dc02c9732ceac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不管出多少汗都能应对，\n我带了很多毛巾。尽情大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28adb5cbc46decc1812e253ee7edd76d7bd4808319ec6da4716f96492b271d9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f19ae631a86cc3eb5e23de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间和体力都是有限的。\n必须好好控制节奏，\n一步步推进才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "471c295d931d142c85381e21927c5c218ca082ffeb31980f1886867415a76ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b45857e8454130005e62890",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的，准备工作已经——\n……等、啊！\n忘了带饮料了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b1047ed7b10dc9939295d251885e054f50f3c6b4f32b10af2af2615e9fd795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc15ceefe84db4c470fb287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我听听你的想法！\n我想把你的想法和我的主意结合起来，\n寻找一条更好的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5cfb7b206d3c9a85ece5be8b590d7ed67329e3c615de2e06cbcbc82d6f04436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afde716f429b78ffd15acd78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有感到疲劳？要是为了配合我\n让你勉强自己的话就不好了，\n如果觉得吃力要立刻告诉我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62521b491e8b23308ba1d3892e448aff49d54479b60e9ed6cbefd8cc26cc155b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e8c39e984f7bb3237ac334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从开始和你并肩而行，\n感觉各种事情都变得顺畅了……\n真的，你很可靠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1369da5eba95e62ccfb3c004200877f400755bf0dc40d0e88d1a8e6eae972dfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0acd9402f46dce8864d01f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～，好清新的空气……！\n感觉能比平时更加集中精神呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06152b166b973fe84c63be03816dd3b3d9fbc274f2a5900363ca2b9c9095d6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8808426031ff7f05696387d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是要进行高强度训练吗？\n太棒了！\n就算是惊涛骇浪我也能驾驭自如！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3cf54514bd1391839d3519c79338bc7dae89dd97e9c48b7f0a1e913cf50be78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4602cbdea49cdfbef67ec766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直每天都想约芭蕾同学去喝早茶。\n跟着她学了柔韧体操后，\n身体都变轻了！怎么谢都谢不够呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "551ac5128777610d19f3eebb2af96bbf27acda1748141cceda23ecd53f26ff8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4a36199b89525a7befe606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至今我还有那些会激励我说“唔好输呀！”的\n国际学校时期的伙伴们。\n……我必须得用结果来回应他们呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e8526ac64506793ccaa71f402c232f0fa28b8cfb739d17f9a3d15a5cb9fdec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817007cae31e610e19e37d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把泥地训练想象成在沙滩度假，\n用这种心态进行心理调适。\n这就是积极面对辛苦训练的秘诀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e3c338db3f3c49c5b8e829e734723ea2656f234cb86dbc8dcb17abe0094ac8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95c9ec64348a8989baa2f50e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能尽情享受假期，多亏了你\n每天的支持。好多谢你！\n……我的心意，传达到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fad5e3422c7c6cf7378ae2dae7b4bd148300bcb108c402471a0506fa9fe9da2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f364126dc899f2fb9dffba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长制定时间表哦。\n为了回报你的付出，我会好好\n规划一场假期的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c31366f70c2208419bb1cf168aacfadefa187c8fcf442d4eb6a934ea0d627ba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac63545e4e42238a37b00db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了一个梦，梦见和你一起\n眺望南海，为胜利干杯。\n我们俩一定要让它成真哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5631c04c052bf59378823c5d15928136c81e907b737bc96f88a7e1acd824743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8295efffe580e3704e6e2932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份荣冠，是我们两个人的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15bf45aae4f3c2c1cbbc17cf7f89eea7dcdde88a9e1231d6a02fe278d4317b7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7821c86b23c9ebd1ee97b673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么样的逆境都克服了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4bdb5a07b418a976392d035a57d22a959f32f751b509f770e0a81a9ba5dfb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d9cf3460df237877befcdd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿我们的名声能够越过大海，传遍各地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9bf11d2b7f64b65e048367e6511360c135aca0bef6c6946fea32e64c8748d6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21ed14f705669783d13528aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是属于我们的巨浪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6ffd650d022043411a6c042c86a7a6e46dbe2d430f9008c3e5a9aa539f7928",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2220d71c7e98263abfd984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成长战略已经完美！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ee80a23e5a6fc351f294532c9f61ac4f7f33ed72cefbcb9512d13060abeb8ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d874a48d399f9bcc228d003e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们打破现状吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "187885a2a238786d832808421ac01eecd2fd52b9a1612f36f4a460bff2374512",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94dfb02ffb9fcfeb050c0ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是里见皇冠。\n请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ca7ac7d04bf019bfb460ef650cb4376f3c7cb1293fa5bd1c5b2ef4f83d42b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e1ab669ae1c83c4154b87b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穷途？逆境？那不是很好吗！\n我燃起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc263f51b9836642d1421738d5bb196ca442378d53bcaaff6dd927d8037f7d1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb972c813101fa9d5f4e14f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是绽放得很美呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c66f712065f48bad274eac423bb1baac25fb07bf7a66dadabdd90ef4b2adc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3f2611b5cebe5ef43ac2586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连盛夏的太阳都要退让三分呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "051234916704924d25aad8a1e8fed80ee4110c0baf8deac83c55a9b8a55aef17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:559606e05e063e0764ddb666",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起跃入\n那蔚蓝闪耀的荣耀中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed07d38add89f4be1c05263b4c95e3cc4481d107b68696ac7643eec4e0b52ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a99abb29612b29888c95fec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是里见皇冠。向着荣光，Let's dive♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "472ba04f7d9f0313d4384d7a7b4d0e94d7676ae2196e784d024a80d4ba8ab2f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5838331fd969ba8cac3e97e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会拖后腿的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb254e1bb8119d4290baf4aea32a2841b65d9c170eba36e5e66c0ea70c36531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b7f9752d156fc39cbb34d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，是你找到了我。\r\n补足了我缺少的东西…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c609b6ca2c0548005b34902e58dd34b9543f5082f028da4235f7b6cf4b3a9a1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934e8dd46c3885f8bc54d05f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dba83c0e829fdbb8cd279d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36d91e575814300e75efc8196ccbffa57be932fd04e63e8909b0c9b00f936add",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bddf4ece9fe8cd7e85898a98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，我想回应训练员眼里…\r\n对我的……期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0436ff6f19876d0879447143495b14af3cfe24846a78bf28b3af7ff149a5b7d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ec993617272f6150388f89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为训练员说选中了我…\r\n所以我…我也想要相信自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ec24cbef54996c6b8f78d8739803523d25fb73bbed685d9207c270b17ad23a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3518cf615735594e937d699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，今年我一定要成为\r\n能够挺起胸膛的我…！一定…\r\n不，是绝对…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f584944e9b59be716056cc80dbd61a27a87b994bcc0b35bfdcb51dc7fa1e412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f94504f07502b1bd586bc333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员…！今天，情…\r\n情、情人…………不，\r\n对不起，没什么事…",
      "source_fingerprint": "202c3490067cc4b16582b64002f57e83b641916cf91bbb2e9a3e48cc85f29394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:127289217c6394443e6c9195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧、巧…………巧克力！！\r\n因为是情人节…！\r\n这个是对平时…照顾的…谢礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07efe7264dbf0b97f0316cf326b4bcfeb975e0665ea808b41e56bacb9374fe27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb742947e4790a70d7123a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纸条该挂在哪里呢。\r\n因为不想挂在显眼的位置，\r\n最后就挂到阴影里了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "09430a6d883f9d070712db320f9f1e8d24b16e9246a2588820f68ae22cf8f700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a447756221b0a3034ff53967",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "t、tr、trick or treat…\r\n不把糖果给我的话…啊啊！？\r\n不、不是的，这个只是在练习…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f61aadcd544cc0de37488c3b522b7a05d7518805ad48e3e06c10b8ebf166ae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2d610b8c43bdf8ee26b94e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家每年举办的圣诞派对\r\n都太盛大了…就算想要抽身离开\r\n也绝对会被妹妹发现…",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff312ddc053801f9d6139e0e41a6fe80e1daa098ae21b62bef943b24e595b2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eb97e589a470cf28394dada",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海边的灯饰好漂亮…\r\n好想在更近的地方看看…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf9a9d0785c67c919d0e5e62344f3f8c274aa82d6edbc74c44d33754a0d61e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c64d6bdcb019530dae2fe0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有做出贡献吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea84d09d1e3170d2a0b235df89e96383003d357484a9f0105fe65a7ce49dd67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be889bc7222837c939d1723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回乡的土特产该怎么选呢…\r\n要不就选些大家喜欢的\r\n看起来很华丽的东西吧…好难啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0371be790d62867d1e1e78c189f755212b1ee50996a97dd5fbdb2cc0bd7b548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:620bbc418c1a43d4ae80268f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "happy birthday，\r\n to you…♪\r\n…祝、祝贺你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f8831a345546f2919b57bd6ff14f9aa4e2e74e9529dd03f44a54bdecd9c04d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7a520b4b8a644aa0cb4908",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，这是我…准备的生日礼物。\r\n是、是很漂亮的贝壳钥匙圈…\r\n因为感觉和训练员的眼睛很像",
      "source_fingerprint": "3483525e272901385c721a511044233aab96fef592fe780d3fb6c1c346f29fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f80c86ae077f705ab72fbb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸妈妈给我寄礼物过来了。\r\n…今年应该也会有好吃的吧…嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c48fd0b671772bf907030f2e3b6f41a10abcbff3031f8b7dac643c1cc85b4c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:300be75614681b14dc699426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这，是我的生日礼物吗？\r\n那个…哪怕只有祝福，\r\n我都已经满心欢喜了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4402687a94a2f5d32247d133f51ef65a4fbd55b3899d08ebfde949592d5acee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e519b159b1007255abd814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了。那个，如果你很忙的话\r\n我可以去帮忙看一下…\r\n如果可以让我去的话…",
      "source_fingerprint": "32bff09b6654a2808f99c8981cf1a7f4cc0067ee9c537259949fcb40c260f82e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a31907104364e5846d922ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是送给训练员的礼物，\r\n我已经整理好放在桌上了…\r\n请记得收下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9337a0785e8370e15a1f5dea319f464ecbc75f8cb4188c5ad8a138b6464fd0d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54215f3890cc2514cf507c54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是任务完成了吗。\r\n…好厉害，我也得向你学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "044156f05deceefecc463263c31482098aba3f0a3d47ac8e38d6b00b376ea739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a9e5e3510344a7a757d75f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是活动吗…\r\n我…我在旁边学习一下吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c291f584d949076cd14ffa4954222f0c1bed201e247b81e3524ca6b1aa915d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:529c679b819de8120df6486d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是活动吗…看起来好开心啊。\r\n但是想融入进去的话…唔…",
      "source_fingerprint": "665d6fc4c1919720d089d3577216b6a2cfdb62f19e0f350c0f5d8da16b4a004c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28132fc9ca43e29a0fa097b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对、对不起…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba7cc33bcdbb1d7736c730b99a261eb64b2c95a1085768e6a7afafe10497f50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:949c5e8f671a69e054372c39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…赛马娘名鉴，\r\n等级好像提高了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "556035c158037b18b9e8d0ccba432b622a9e9e886bba88baae9336ad07704665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97955fa9780a86a20127420c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕，只差一步…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f90663d72d33bf05867faacc4190f0a5228678137b521a9884bfc192a6f0f5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "1003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
